OL,3,GNEWSAOpposition to grill Reform on care
OL,4,Ahome closures
OL,5,
OL,6,FA local authority's decision to close
OL,7,Fits last remaining care homes has been
OL,8,Fcalled in for a review by opposition
OL,9,Fgroups.
OL,11,FEarlier this month, Reform UK-run West
OL,12,FNorthamptonshire Council approved
OL,13,Fproposals to reshape several
OL,14,Fcouncil-run provisions, affecting 250
OL,15,Fpeople, including 81 who live in
OL,16,FSouthfields House and Obelisk House
OL,17,Fcare homes in Northampton.
OL,19,FConservative group leader Dan Lister
OL,20,Fsaid the measures had been approved
OL,21,F"without setting out clearly how the
OL,22,Fpeople affected will be looked after".
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
